{"Result":{"LocationInstructions":"<p class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\">ATTENTION:</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">This application is for Residential Planning Entitlements only.</span></span></p><p class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\">Instructions:</span></span></span></p><ol class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Click on the + sign to add a location.</span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Enter address into the search field for the primary residence. Once populated, select the address.</span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">If address is not found, please click on \"Enter Manually.\"</span></span></li></ol>","BasicInfoInstructions":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">Note:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-size: 16px;\">Please enter a detailed scope of work in the description field. Be sure to provide a comprehensive explanation of the work you plan to do, and ensure that this explanation matches your plans. Valuation is optional.</span></span></p>","ContactInstructions":"<p class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\">Instructions:</span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">To search for an existing contact:</span></span></p><ol class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Click the&nbsp;+&nbsp;sign.</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Enter the contact's name or business name in the search field.</span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Once the search results are populated, select the contact you want to add and click the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt;\">Add&nbsp;button.</span></li></ol><p class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">If the contact is not found:</span></span></p><ol class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Click&nbsp;Enter Manually.</span></li></ol><p class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\">Required Contacts:</span></span></p><ul class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Applicant</span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Owner</span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Contractor (If applicable)</span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Engineer (If applicable)</span></span></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Architect (If applicable)</span></span></li></ul>","MoreInfoInstructions":"<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 1em; font-family: &quot;PT Sans Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(88, 106, 105);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-decoration: inherit;\"><span style=\"background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\">Note:</span><span style=\"background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: inherit;\">Please be sure</span><span style=\"background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: unset; text-align: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: inherit;\">to re view and submit all required documents to avoid delays in processing your application.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><img src=\"https://gis.lagunabeachcity.net/MapsLinks/PublicGIS/ResidentialProjectSubmittalsRequirements.jpg\" class=\"e-rte-image e-imginline\" alt=\"ResidentialProjectSubmittalsRequirements.jpg\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" style=\"min-width: 0px; max-width: 2609px; min-height: 0px;\"> </p>","AttachmentInstructions":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Development applications submitted to the Planning Division\nmust identify the specific entitlement or approval requested. Please complete\nand submit the applicable forms for each requested entitlement or approval.\nConsult the Laguna Beach Municipal Code to determine the requirements for your\nproject. If no discretionary planning entitlement is required but zoning review\nis still necessary, submit a Zone Clearance Application.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Attachments<o:p></o:p></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#EE0000\">Note:</span> To avoid\ndelays, please submit all required documents. If you submit an incomplete\napplication, we will send you a correction request before reviewing your plans.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#EE0000\">Instructions:</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"ng-scope\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;\"><br></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\">Applicants\n     must submit the following:<o:p></o:p></li>\n <ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"circle\">\n  <li class=\"MsoNormal\">All\n      application forms that apply, based on the specific entitlements or\n      approvals requested (<a href=\"https://www.lagunabeachcity.net/government/departments/community-development/planning-zoning/applications-handouts\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Planning Applications and Handouts\">link to\n      webpage</a>)<o:p></o:p></li>\n  <li class=\"MsoNormal\">All required\n      application materials (plans, technical studies, etc.) as identified in<b>\n      </b>the applicable application forms.<o:p></o:p></li>\n </ul>\n</ul><p><br></p>"},"Success":true,"ErrorMessage":"","ValidationErrorMessage":"","ConcurrencyErrorMessage":"","StatusCode":200,"BrokenRules":[]}